#
# The shapes that are refused, each still running in the workers and
# shipping its rows: Parallel_partial_aggregations stays 0 while
# Parallel_queries_executed does not.
#
# 1 a computed group expression: the key is over shipped columns only
# 2 a constant group expression, which leaves no key to group by
# 3 a select list item over a column the group does not determine
# 4 a select list item over an aggregate, whose columns are not told
#   apart from a bare one's
# 5 an aggregate with no direct_add overload, here BIT_XOR
#
# WITH ROLLUP is not among them because it does not reach here at all: it
# is one of the plans that wants its rows already grouped, and
# run_worker_side_join() declines those outright -- see
# main.parallel_query_group_by.
preaggregated_per_scan
0.0000
every_shape_still_ran_in_the_workers
1
